bound-lock/1 about="the shape every capsule keeps, read of each from its lines and the receipts of its code: one file per line, short regions, helpers written once, vectors from two worlds, rendered manifests and indexes, declared effects, no views of a place, and no place, case or customisation spelled in code" at=witness:a-frame-that-was-not-a-place by=target form=alphabet measure=text role=writes scope=prose/en/frame/what value=lock
